## MCServerJars Architecture

- **Framework**: Next.js 15 (App Router) + React 19 + TypeScript 5
- **Runtime/PM**: Bun (see `bun.lock`). Prefer `bun run` for scripts.
- **Purpose**: Programmatic SEO-focused registry for Minecraft server jars (Paper, Spigot, Vanilla, Fabric, etc.)

### Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|------------|
| Frontend | Next.js 15 (App Router) with ISR |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS v3 |
| Database | Supabase (PostgreSQL) |
| Backend API | Rust (Axum) at `api.mcserverjars.com` |
| Automation | GitHub Actions (indexers) |
| Deployment | Vercel (frontend), Hetzner VPS (API) |

